# Keep the Braintrailz trail current

`trailz/references/braintrailz.md` is the trail map for this skill — why
decisions were made, not a changelog or session transcript.

When building or changing this project:

- After a durable design choice (trigger words, save format, fallback
  behavior, packaging), add or update a short section in `braintrailz.md`
- Capture the *why* and the test for the decision; skip back-and-forth and
  housekeeping detail
- Match the existing voice: trail markers, reusable patterns, no fence
- If `trailz/` source changed in a way that should ship, rebuild
  `trailz.skill` (zip of `trailz/`)

This project is held to its own standard. Any edit that makes a file longer
without making it more useful is the wrong edit.

Do not dump full conversations into the trail. Prefer one tight section per
decision.
